"g006|Feather Drop|Arcade / Precision|js|hold|watercolor|Hold to slow your fall. Release to drop fast. Land on a lily pad without cracking it.|Fall through a column of lily pads, slowing only when you need to thread a gap or land softly.|Landing damage accumulates across the whole descent, so one hard landing ruins an otherwise perfect run.|Infinite: pad spacing, sizes and drift speeds are generated, with wind layers added every few hundred metres.|A single button controls speed, so the difficulty lives entirely in reading the gap ahead.|precision,hold,one-button,endless",

"g007|Chain Reaction Lab|Puzzle / Physics|js|tap|terminal|Tap one molecule and watch the chain split. Reach every target before the reaction fizzles.|Each level is a cluster of unstable molecules. One tap starts a cascade that must touch all the targets.|Different molecule colours have different split radii and delays, so you are designing a chain, not just starting one.|Levels are generated from a parameter set (count, colour mix, target scatter) with a puzzle-solver verifying solvability.|The solver guarantee means every generated level is provably fair, which removes the main frustration of generator games.|puzzle,chain-reaction,procedural,tap",

