"g024|Balloon Static|Physics / Puzzle|js|drag|pastel|Rub a balloon to build static, then use the charge to pull or repel objects.|Charge balloons and move them near objects to drag, lift or launch them toward targets.|Charge decays over time and spreads to nearby objects, so managing electricity is a resource game in a cute costume.|Endless workshop levels with object weights, charge capacities and target arrangements.|Electrostatic attraction is a mechanic almost nobody has built a full game around.|physics,puzzle,resource,drag",

